examples.question_text:
The box plot shows test scores. State the five-number summary and find the range.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.16cm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw[black,<->] (-2,0)--(52,0);
\foreach \v in {0,...,50} {\draw[black] (\v,-0.05)--(\v,0.05);}
\foreach \v in {0,10,...,50} {\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\v,-0.12) {$\v$};}
\node[below] at (25,-0.65) {Score};
\draw[black,thick] (12,1.3)--(18,1.3) (39,1.3)--(47,1.3);
\draw[black,thick] (12,1.1)--(12,1.5) (47,1.1)--(47,1.5);
\draw[black,thick] (18,0.9) rectangle (39,1.7);
\draw[black,thick] (27,0.9)--(27,1.7);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

